<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Carlsberg 6-mth net up 16.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Carlsberg 6-mth net up 16.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 43.5    vs	  37.3</p>
<p>    Net profit		  44.34   vs	  38.04</p>
<p>    Turnover		   341.47   vs	 288.50</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    63.14   vs	  55.54</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	10.0    vs	  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Carlsberg Brewery Malaysia Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
